{"b":2,"c":25,"v":[[1,[["And the LORD spake unto Moses in mount Sinai, saying,",[[1,19,1],[3,1,1],[3,10,11],[3,10,12],[47,4,24],[47,4,25]]]]],[2,[["When ye",[[2,14,34],[4,32,8],[4,32,49],[4,34,4],[18,24,1],[18,24,2],[18,115,16],[22,8,8],[23,27,5]]],["keep",[[2,23,32]]],["a sabbath",[[2,26,34],[2,26,35],[1,23,10],[13,36,21]]]]],[4,[["But in the seventh year shall be a sabbath of rest unto the land, a sabbath for the LORD: thou shalt neither sow thy field, nor prune thy vineyard.",[[2,25,20],[2,25,21],[2,25,22],[2,25,23],[2,26,34],[2,26,35],[2,26,43],[1,23,10],[1,23,11],[13,36,21]]]]],[5,[["groweth",[[11,19,29],[22,37,30]]]]],[6,[["And the sabbath of the land shall be meat for you; for thee, and for thy servant, and for thy maid, and for thy hired servant, and for thy stranger that sojourneth with thee,",[[1,23,11],[43,2,44],[43,4,32],[43,4,34],[43,4,35]]]]],[8,[["And thou shalt number seven sabbaths of years unto thee, seven times seven years; and the space of the seven sabbaths of years shall be unto thee forty and nine years.",[[2,23,15],[0,2,2]]]]],[9,[["of the jubilee to sound",[[3,10,10],[18,89,15],[43,13,38],[43,13,39],[44,10,18],[44,15,19],[46,5,19],[46,5,20],[46,5,21],[51,1,8]]],["jubilee",[[2,25,10],[2,25,11],[2,25,12],[2,27,17],[2,27,24],[3,36,4]]],["the day",[[2,16,20],[2,16,30],[2,23,24],[2,23,27]]]]],[10,[["proclaim",[[1,20,2],[14,1,3],[18,146,7],[22,49,9],[22,49,24],[22,49,25],[22,61,1],[22,61,2],[22,61,3],[22,63,4],[23,34,8],[23,34,13],[23,34,14],[23,34,15],[23,34,16],[23,34,17],[37,9,11],[37,9,12],[41,1,74],[41,4,16],[41,4,17],[41,4,18],[41,4,19],[41,4,20],[41,4,21],[42,8,32],[42,8,33],[42,8,34],[42,8,35],[42,8,36],[44,6,17],[44,6,18],[46,3,17],[47,4,25],[47,4,26],[47,4,27],[47,4,28],[47,4,29],[47,4,30],[47,4,31],[47,5,1],[47,5,13],[59,2,16],[60,2,19],[60,2,20]]],["every man",[[2,25,13],[2,25,26],[2,25,27],[2,25,28],[2,25,33],[2,25,34],[2,27,17],[2,27,18],[2,27,19],[2,27,20],[2,27,21],[2,27,22],[2,27,23],[2,27,24]]],["ye shall return",[[3,36,2],[3,36,